  description: '1 Tuner + 1+ non-Tuner monsters

    If this card is Special Summoned:
    You can add 1 Spell/Trap that mentions "Crimson Dragon" from your Deck to your
    hand. (Quick Effect): You can target 1 Level 7 or higher Synchro Monster on the
    field, except "Crimson Dragon"; return this card to the Extra Deck, and if you
    do, Special Summon 1 Dragon Synchro Monster from your Extra Deck with the same
    Level as the targeted monster. (This is treated as a Synchro Summon.) You can
    only use each effect of "Crimson Dragon" once per turn.'
